{
    "background_story": "Esmeralda was a mysterious and enigmatic figure, shrouded in an aura of darkness. Her presence seemed to draw the light out of the room, leaving only an unsettling feeling in her wake. It was said that she possessed a baneful influence, capable of cursing those who crossed her path. The villagers whispered about her alleged dealings with malevolent forces, and how her gaze could wither the crops and poison the wells. One fateful night, a group of brave souls decided to confront Esmeralda, but she vanished into the shadows, leaving behind a trail of misfortune and calamity. From that day on, the village was plagued by a series of unexplained disasters, and Esmeralda's name became synonymous with evil and destruction. Her baneful powers seemed to have a life of their own, striking fear into the hearts of all who knew her name.",
